      "statement": "PIR-2024-07 documents the impact of INC-2024-1182 as 1,240 wires delayed, 312 wires released after the 6:00 p.m. ET Fedwire cutoff, and 14 clients compensated $41,800 in interest claims, with no regulatory notification required.",
