      "statement": "PIR-2024-07 identifies root causes of INC-2024-1182 as a polling architecture against a shared synchronous API with no client-side backoff, lack of capacity testing at month-end volumes, and unvalidated status semantics with Compliance/Legal, and lists adoption of the event-driven status pattern (ADR-PAY-019) and a PPH v1 rate limit of 20 TPS as resulting actions.",
      "evidence": [
